# Deepfake Audio Model – Debugging & Optimization Log

## 1. Initial Setup

* Model: AudioResNet18 (binary classification)
* Input: Log-Mel Spectrograms (1 × 128 × T)
* Dataset: FakeAVCeleb (aligned with video split)
* Labels:

  * 0 → Real Audio (RR + FR)
  * 1 → Fake Audio (RF + FF)

